  "name": "chem170met_base_state_inputs",
  "description": "Base-state column of the chem_opt = 170 reference column (em_scm_xy, Kansas, 59 layers, p_top 5710.94 Pa, mub 94289.05469 Pa) for WRFColumnGeometry's time-invariant rewrite targets, from wrfout frame 0 of data/eqwefic/chem170_scm/run_full_met.sh (identical in every frame). alpha_b is not in the history; it is recovered from the base geopotential the way module_initialize_scm_xy built it (hybrid_opt = 0: phb(k+1) = phb(k) - dnw(k) mub alb(k)), with the eta spacing Geo itself forms, so Geo's inverse dry density is exactly -(d(phb + ph)/deta)/mu_d. Generated by tools/fill_eqatmchem_scm_tests.py -- do not edit.",
